        <mxCell id="c382" value="each bit points away from the most recent access; a hit flips the bits on its path. Here the victim is way 7. Prime+Retouch reproduced the predicted misses." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#4b5563;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
